Package: jujutsu
Version: 0.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Depends: git (>= 2.41.0)
Maintainer: Shish <shish@shishnet.org>
Description: A Git-compatible version control system
 jj is a Git-compatible version control system that is both simple
 and powerful. It provides an intuitive interface while maintaining
 full compatibility with Git repositories.
